{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_211_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_211","textTraditional":"一、三十年，春，王正月，公在乾侯。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_211_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_211","textTraditional":"中國不存公。存公故也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_211_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_211","textTraditional":"二、夏，六月，庚辰，晉侯去疾卒。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_211_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_211","textTraditional":"三、秋，八月，葬晉頃公。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_211_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_211","textTraditional":"四、冬，十有二月，吳滅徐，徐子章羽奔楚。","sentenceOrder":5}],"overrides":{}}